[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0010","text":"制，制作人……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0020","text":"服装，有没有奇怪的地方……？\n穿好了吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0030","text":"啊，没问题哦。而且\n不是也让造型师好好检查过了吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0040","text":"说、说是这么说啦……！\n嘿嘿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0050","text":"──甜花呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0060","text":"这套服装……\n能被粉丝们看到……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0070","text":"好期待……\n好紧张……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0080","text":"……嗯，是啊\n我也很期待，也在紧张呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0090","text":"嘿嘿……\n那──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_03_0100","text":"制作人也是，\n和甜花穿同款……呢……！"}]
